_S \\subseteq \\mathsf{Class}^2\\times V^2\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcLargecard3UltrapowerEmbedding}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcLcUltrapowerEmbeddingByMeasure}_S \\subseteq \\mathsf{Class}^2\\times V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcLargecard3UltrapowerEmbedding}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcLcUltrapowerEmbeddingByMeasure}_S \\subseteq \\mathsf{Class}^2\\times V^2\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}largecard2\\text{-}ultrapower\\text{-}embedding} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcLargecard2UltrapowerEmbedding}_S(j,M,U,\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{Ultrafilter}_S(U,\\kappa)\\land M=V^\\kappa/U\\land j:V\\to M\\land\\forall x\\in V\\;(j(x)=[c_x]_U)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}largecard2\\text{-}ultrapower\\text{-}embedding} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcLargecard2UltrapowerEmbedding}_S(j,M,U,\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{Ultrafilter}_S(U,\\kappa)\\land M=V^\\kappa/U\\land j:V\\to M\\land\\forall x\\in V\\;(j(x)=[c_x]_U)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}largecard2\\text{-}ultrapower\\text{-}embedding\\text{-}largecard3} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcLargecard3UltrapowerEmbedding}_S(j,M,U,\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{ZfcLargecard2UltrapowerEmbedding}_S(j,M,U,\\kappa)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}largecard2\\text{-}ultrapower\\text{-}embedding\\text{-}largecard3} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcLargecard3UltrapowerEmbedding}_S(j,M,U,\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{ZfcLargecard2UltrapowerEmbedding}_S(j,M,U,\\kappa)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}largecard2\\text{-}ultrapower\\text{-}embedding\\text{-}lc} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcLcUltrapowerEmbeddingByMeasure}_S(j,M,U,\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{ZfcLargecard2UltrapowerEmbedding}_S(j,M,U,\\kappa)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}largecard2\\text{-}ultrapower\\text{-}embedding\\text{-}lc} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcLcUltrapowerEmbeddingByMeasure}_S(j,M,U,\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{ZfcLargecard2UltrapowerEmbedding}_S(j,M,U,\\kappa)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The source universe, ultrapower target, and embedding are proper classes interpreted in the metatheory; the set-sized index <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span> and ultrafilter <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\">\\(U\\)</span> are explicit.</li>\n<li><code>58-df-zfc-largecard3-ultrapower-embedding</code> and <code>58-df-zfc-lc-ultrapower-embedding-by-measure</code> are merged here; they used the same ultrapower map clause with reordered parameters.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch15/58-df-ultrapower.md","status":"resolved","id":"80d22bbd3f726e33","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-ultrapower.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"V","display":false},{"tex":"j,M\\in\\mathsf{Class}","display":false},{"tex":"U,\\kappa\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcLargecard2UltrapowerEmbedding}_S \\subseteq \\mathsf{Class}^2\\times V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcLargecard3UltrapowerEmbedding}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcLcUltrapowerEmbeddingByMeasure}_S \\subseteq \\mathsf{Class}^2\\times V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\tex